{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/02/17/0538172/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばそわヽ(^ω^)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/02/17/0538172/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真剣にメイクを落とす、まりか（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は、ぶあああ！！って感じで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間も忘れちゃうくらい充実した毎日を過ごしています┗(^o^ )┓<33"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいことだぜ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それで最近ね、気分転換に読んだ占いの本が面白くって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって、ズバッと当てるんだもん！o(^o^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず、基本の性格ってのがね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「 保守的で慎重な人です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"警戒心が強く、人見知りで融通が利かないところがありますが、手堅く道を切り開いていく人です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"義理と人情に熱く、静かに闘争心を燃やす人です。 」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それで、本質(裏の顔)ってのもやってみたら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「 アイドルのように、あなたも多くの人から愛されます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一見ピュアなイメージを持たれやすいですが、その裏には、与えられた役割を演じきる完璧主義者の顔が隠れています。どんなときでも、絶対に妥協はしないはず。 」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごい！アイドルて！なんでわかったの！すごい！なんでーっ！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも、めっちゃ当たってる......！なんてこった／(^o^)＼パンナコッタ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういうのって、たまたまなのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとなのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まるで自分のことを見ながら書かれてるような文章に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一人で アタフタしてた井上でした（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んでこの感動を誰かに伝えたかった井上でした（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんは、占いって信じますかー(ｏ・ω・ｏ）？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問にこたえるよ(ミ＾o＾ミ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎   さゆにゃんは誰にチョコあげるの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お兄ちゃんとか・・・？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊    小中高って吹奏楽部だったから、毎年部活仲間にあげてたんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人数多すぎて、何日も前から準備したりして...女の子の友チョコって大変(*_*）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よって、お兄ちゃんなんかに作ってる暇はナイっ！（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"失敗作ならｗ えへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっき、このブログを書いてる途中で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うとうとして寝ちゃったんだけど（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その時に不思議な夢をみた！(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ある雑貨屋さんで、植物の声が聞ける機械みたいなのを見つけて、それを買ってきて、お花たちとお話する夢で。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まるで、絵本の中に迷いこんだような世界観でした(* ^o^ *)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにその機械の値段は、2500円だったｗｗｗ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかそこだけめっちゃ現実的ｗｗｗ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2014/02/17/0538172/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるん！お誕生日おめでとう！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大人っぽくて日に日にキレイになっていくちはるん！でも話すとめっちゃ面白い！！！（ミ＾o＾ミ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年下なのに、たまについ、頼りたくなってしまう存在です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもよろしくね＊＊ だいすきっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(。・ω・。)正義！"}],"source":"archive"}